<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>7 - George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>5 - Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza),</p>
<p>Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>4 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Enrico Chiesa (Parma)</p>
<p>3 - Roberto Baggio and Marco Simone (both Milan), Gabriel</p>
<p>Batistuta (Fiorentina), Oliver Bierhoff (Udinese), Sandro</p>
<p>Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
<p>2 - Dino Baggio and Gianfranco Zola (both Parma), Massimo</p>
<p>Beghetto (Vicenza), Giovanni Bia and Paolo Poggi (Udinese),</p>
<p>Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Youri Djorkaeff (Inter), Daniel Fonseca</p>
<p>(Roma), Federico Giunti and Marco Negri (Perugia), Igor</p>
<p>Kolyvanov, Carlo Nervo and Davide Fontolan (all Bologna),</p>
<p>Roberto Mancini and Vincenzo Montella (both Sampdoria), Luis</p>
<p>Oliveira (Fiorentina), Michele Padovano and Ciro Ferrara</p>
<p>(Juventus), Giuseppe Signori (Lazio), Antonio De Vitis (Verona)</p>
</text>
